{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2762,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.redlaser42.ghostvoice",
  "name": "Ghost Voice",
  "slug": "ghost-voice",
  "teaser": "Adds Ghost from MW2 2009",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/thUsbWCRNHfzDk2XLvtnUjZoYaNqh89Z8c6jgXni.jpg",
  "downloads": 2072,
  "favourites_count": 10,
  "description": "<p>Work in progress voice mod.</p>\n<p>This mod adds a new voice, Ghost, voiced by Craig Fairbrass. Lines were taken from Modern Warfare 2 (2009) and Call of Duty 4 (Gaz). All lines are clean, genuine recordings. No AI.</p>\n<p>Currently up to 151 voice lines including line variations.\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://youtu.be/f7bCuRnfccQ\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://youtu.be/f7bCuRnfccQ</a></p>\n<p>I recommend Smooth Talker, as one of my goals will be to give those voice lines as much variety as possible.\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2635/smooth-talker\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2635/smooth-talker</a></p>\n<p>You can edit the bot types this voice may be chosen for by editing the config in \\SPT\\user\\mods\\Ghost Voice\\db\\CustomVoices\\GhostVoice.json</p>\n<p>Here is a list of all the bots: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://wiki.sp-tarkov.com/en/modding/references/bot-types\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://wiki.sp-tarkov.com/en/modding/references/bot-types</a></p>\n<p>Check against voice weights for each bot type in \\SPT\\SPT_Data\\database\\bots\\types\\</p>\n<p>Appreciation and Acknowledgement:</p>\n<p>Please thank ConcreteMeshTank957 (Topham) for supplying the voice lines on YouTube.\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@american_renaissance\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.youtube.com/@american_renaissance</a></p>\n<p>Please thank the WTT developers for the custom Unity tools, and thank AvienReactor for their voice mod creation guide and template: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/AvienReactor/JellyVoices/wiki/How-to-make-a-SPT-voice-mod\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/AvienReactor/JellyVoices/wiki/How-to-make-a-SPT-voice-mod</a>.</p>\n<p>Thank you to the author of the SPT modding resource.</p>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2762/ghost-voice",
